```
var firstArray = script.actor.get_node(0).get_property("myArray")
var secondArray = script.actor.get_node(0).get_property("subArray")
var thirdArray = script.actor.get_property("mylayaArray")
for i in firstArray :
   print(i)
   print(secondArray[i])
   print(thirdArray[i])
```

In this example, "myArray" is the name of the outer array, and "subArray" is the name of the inner array that contains the nested array. The loop iterates over each element in each array, accessing the index of each value in the loop using the `get_property()` method. Then it prints out each value.
